        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Panic Device Thumb Lift Handleset</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Class Room Function Handleset (Outside thumb lift locked and unlocked by Key) for all Wide and Medium Stile Doors (aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole prep. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200r\"><b>4200 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200v\"><b>4200 Series Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-vertical-rod-exit-device-pdq-4200v-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-rim-exit-device-pdq-4200r-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Rim Exit Device</b></a>, \r\n Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Rim Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-grade-2-surface-vertical-rod-door-panic-device-th1100edsvtbar\"><b>TH1100EDSVTBAR Surface Vertical Rod Panic Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with rim lock cylinder, mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 4-GW-05 Thumb Lift Handleset \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside thumb lift locked and unlocked by Key.</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Height: 12-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with Lock Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/429GPK.pdf?v=1704262276\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 4-GW-05 Installation Template & Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in your choice of powder coated Aluminum, Dark Bronze (Duro) or plated Polished Brass.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Panic Device Thumb Lift Handleset, PDQ 4-GW-05",
                "description": "PDQ 4-GW-05 Class Room Function Handleset (key locks and unlocks thumb lift) with thumb lift. For use with PDQ 4200 Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices, PDQ 4200 Vertical Rod Exit Device and other manufactures Panic Devices. Available in Aluminum, Dark Bronze (Duro) or Polished Brass finish. Packaged with rim lock cylinder, mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.",
